  "comment": "The links canonkeeper:// the export to Obsidian writes (specs/2026-11-16-desk-links-writer.md LW1.3) by the values the domain holds: the id of the saga, the id of the chapter and the number of the paragraph — no p is the chapter itself. link is what the writer writes, \"\" for no link: the caption stays text. The test of domain/obsidian holds the writer to this table; the test of the core of the shell (desktop/src-tauri/crates/core/src/link.rs) parses every link by AL1.1 (specs/2026-11-16-desk-app-links.md) to the same place, in the form it gives the page, and refuses the link built of the values of a row without one. p is never 0: to the writer 0 is no paragraph.",
